| API | Measures | Available |
|-----|----------|-----------|
| `.lineHeight()` | Baseline to baseline | iOS 26+ |
| `.lineSpacing()` | Bottom of line to top of next | iOS 13+ |
| `.font(.body.leading(.tight))` | Font-level leading preset | iOS 14+ |

